m/di/media/images/dw/20240712/888413734060429312924361.jpeg/KzwoVHEP_BG4mydEcKCeIjh76RoUqgwA0ZkvndGZL50\"/><figcaption>驅蚊｜8種人最易成蚊叮對象！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"驅蚊｜8種人最易成蚊叮對象！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240712/888413736069632000742635.jpeg/FvQXAzxmI6ahYKinbQy_d_xmMW2bLnqi6n_OWep_zlk\"/><figcaption>驅蚊｜8種人最易成蚊叮對象！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文經《風傳媒》授權轉載，原文：家中蚊子不斷冒出怎麼辦？昆蟲專家用1招有效滅蚊，飛進屋前就全部陣亡】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T03:58:21.511153+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1632,"images":40,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}